#: ../../how-to/node-usage.md:1
msgid "使用 SLE 节点实体"
msgstr "Using the SLE Node Entity"

#: ../../how-to/node-usage.md:3
msgid ""
"`SleNode` 是项目的顶层实体, 封装了物理层 (`TxConfig`, TX/RX Pipeline)、MAC 层 "
"(`LinkManager`, `QosManager`, `Scheduler`) 和安全 (`FrameCryptoContext`) 的全部功能,"
" 对外提供统一的数据收发接口。"
msgstr ""
"`SleNode` is the project's top-level entity, encapsulating the physical "
"layer (`TxConfig`, TX/RX Pipeline), MAC layer (`LinkManager`, `QosManager`, "
"`Scheduler`), and security (`FrameCrypto`, `PairingManager`). This guide "
"demonstrates common configuration and usage patterns."

